sequenceDiagram
    participant US as Userspace loader
    participant BPF as BPF skeleton
    participant K as Kernel
    participant TCP as TCP CC subsystem
    participant SOCK as Application socket

    US->>BPF: load .bpf.o
    BPF->>K: BPF_PROG_LOAD for each callback
    BPF->>K: BPF_MAP_CREATE (struct_ops type)
    K->>TCP: tcp_register_congestion_control(my_bpf_ops)
    Note over TCP: 'my_bpf_ops' now in CC list

    SOCK->>K: setsockopt(TCP_CONGESTION, "my_bpf_ops")
    K->>TCP: switch CC for this socket
    TCP->>BPF: invoke bbr_init_bpf(sk)
    Note over BPF: BPF program runs as the CC algorithm
    SOCK->>SOCK: TCP traffic uses BPF-defined behavior

    US->>BPF: skeleton__destroy
    BPF->>K: unload struct_ops map
    K->>TCP: tcp_unregister_congestion_control(my_bpf_ops)
